[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Each browser load observes a fresh StrictDoc JSON export

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SDOC-PERSPECTIVE-FRESH-DATA
TITLE: Each browser load observes a fresh StrictDoc JSON export
DEPTH: interface-settled
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
Every data API request MUST start a new strictdoc JSON export after the request arrives, read it only from a fresh temporary directory, and remove that directory whether the request succeeds or fails. A repository export, a retained export file, and a process-level data cache MUST NOT satisfy the request.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Reload is the explicit refresh operation for this spike, so its data must reflect the files visible to the exporter at request time.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: DEC-SDOC-PERSPECTIVE-EXPORT-BOUNDARY
  ROLE: Governed_By
